        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk2-quantities-p04-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "万 / 多: Use number+classifier in identifiers",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "A number in an identifier labels something rather than counting it. Distinguish 三号房间, room number three, from 三间房间, three rooms.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我在三号房间。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ zài sān hào fángjiān 。",
                "meaning": "I am in room number three.",
                "audio": "b6475d2dd2a3891d4b1e3ba77fae4d41ec29edc524860d266e34469f92b438dc"
              },
              {
                "text": "这里有三间房间。",
                "pinyin": "zhèlǐ yǒu sān jiān fángjiān 。",
                "meaning": "There are three rooms here.",
                "audio": "8a946e914175bba4dec781deade260ed61bb0e62bbff269fc9dc1766ceaef9e0"
              }
            ]
